    "text": "The worldwide launch manifest is set to see 10 launches from sites around the world. Notably, three missions will launch to space stations, with two cargo missions to the ISS and a crewed mission to Tiangong.\n\nJoe Kangas with details ⬇️\n\nwww.nasaspaceflight.com/2026/11/laun...",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3n343mthrkc2o",
    "image": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:yifpqamzwvp3g4szr44mz37r/bafkreihlahamauoxeqdb6i24l45v6cgoklbvonsahlwsptcttcr2yxurry",
