    "text": "China has launched their Shenzhou-24 crewed mission Wednesday at 8:18am local time (00:18 UTC) aboard the Long March 2F/G from Site 91 at the Jiuquan Satellite Launch Center, sending three astronauts to the Chinese Space Station.\n\n[Video Credit 🎥:  CCTV]",
    "url": "https://bsky.app/profile/nasaspaceflight.com/post/3n33x7pg6y22u",
