    "text": "On Saturday, BepiColombo successfully entered orbit around Mercury. The moment wasn't without drama, though, as a software glitch led to a shortened burn.\n\nLet's review BepiColombo's complex journey to Mercury and what exactly happened on Saturday ⬇️\n\nwww.nasaspaceflight.com/2026/11/bepi...",
